[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0429","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0429.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0983","title":"UltraEdit 8.2 FTP客户端弱密码加密漏洞","description":"UltraEdit 8.2 的 FTP 客户端在将 FTP 密码保存至配置文件 uedit32.ini 时，采用了强度极低的自定义加密算法对密码进行保护，而非使用操作系统提供的安全凭据存储机制。本地攻击者只需具备对 uedit32.ini 文件的读取权限，即可通过逆向分析该弱加密算法轻松还原出明文 FTP 密码，进而利用获取的合法凭据登录目标 FTP 服务器，导致用户隐私泄露、未授权文件访问及权限提升。该漏洞影响 UltraEdit 8.2 版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，属于本地攻击场景下的中危安全缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0983"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:21Z","remediation":"立即将 UltraEdit 升级至最新版本（当前为 v21.x 或更高），新版已采用安全加密存储 FTP 凭据。若暂时无法升级，应在 UltraEdit 的 FTP 菜单中取消勾选\"Save Password\"（保存密码）选项，防止弱加密密码写入 uedit32.ini 文件。同时，在文件系统层面收紧 uedit32.ini 的访问权限，仅允许当前用户读写（Windows 右键属性→安全→移除其他用户的读取权限），阻止同机其他用户读取并解密存储的 FTP 密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99861651923668&w=2","http://www.eve-software.com/security/ueditpw.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21091","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0983.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0983","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0983.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0983.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3j67-gcxj-hc23/GHSA-3j67-gcxj-hc23.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-0983.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0983.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151400_151500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9ceeada2-f7cb-40c6-8ac8-de6b04843303.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0429.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0427","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0427.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0965","title":"glFTPD 1.23 LIST命令拒绝服务漏洞","description":"glFTPD 1.23 及更早版本中存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 FTP 的 LIST 命令，向服务器发送包含大量星号（*）字符的特殊参数，导致服务器 CPU 资源被耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞利用方式简单，仅需具备网络访问能力即可触发，影响所有运行 glFTPD 1.x 版本的服务器系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0965"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:19Z","remediation":"升级至 glFTPD 2.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 LIST 命令参数中大量星号导致的 CPU 耗尽问题。如无法升级，可在服务端配置中限制 LIST 命令参数长度或禁用通配符扩展作为临时缓解措施。由于该软件已停止维护，建议迁移至 actively maintained 的 FTP 服务器软件（如 vsftpd、ProFTPD）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-08/0239.html","http://www.glftpd.org/","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7001.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3201","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21074","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0965.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0965","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0965.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0965.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2727-3q8f-vqf3/GHSA-2727-3q8f-vqf3.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-0965.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a404d4ad-cf0b-4ad8-8b17-f8849295c311.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0965.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0427.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0355","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0355.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1009","title":"Fetchmail POP3/IMAP 负整数索引远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Fetchmail 5.8.17 之前版本中存在符号整数索引漏洞，远程恶意的 IMAP 或 POP/POP3 服务器可通过在 LIST 请求的响应中返回负数索引值，触发内存越界写入，导致覆盖任意内存区域，攻击者可能借此实现权限提升。攻击条件为受害者使用 Fetchmail 连接并信任恶意邮件服务器，无需额外认证即可触发，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1009"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:24Z","remediation":"将 fetchmail 升级至 5.8.17 或更高版本。Debian 用户应安装 DSA-071 提供的更新包，Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2001-103 更新，Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2001-072 更新。如无法立即升级，可在邮件服务器配置中禁用 LIST 命令的负索引响应，或限制 fetchmail 仅连接可信的 IMAP/POP3 服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-08/0118.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000419","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-071","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6965.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-072.php3","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1555.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_026_fetchmail_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-103.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3164","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3166","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21064","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2001/CVE-2001-1009.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1009.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1009","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-crwm-xxj2-prrm/GHSA-crwm-xxj2-prrm.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-071.nasl","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1009.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1009.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_400_500.json","https://github.com/anonymous-55443259/CVE_Vul_File_Localization/blob/24756649f99ff5cea566f1e66a7fdd2ed0e7aced/Result/repository/repository_collection/repo_from_gpt/result/CVE-2001-1009/4.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-071.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0355.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0353","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0353.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1002","title":"Red Hat Linux LPD DVI打印过滤器远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 7.0 及更早版本中 DVI 打印过滤器（dvips）的默认配置存在安全漏洞。当 lpd 守护进程调用 dvips 处理打印任务时，未以安全模式运行，导致远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的打印机服务提交特制的 DVI 文件，其中嵌入恶意命令，从而在目标主机上以 lp 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.2/7.0/7.1 等版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1002"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:23Z","remediation":"升级 Red Hat Linux 至 7.2 或更高版本，或在 lpd 的 dvips 打印过滤器配置中为 dvips 命令添加 `-R` 安全模式参数（如将 `dvips` 改为 `dvips -R`），禁止 DVI 文件中内嵌的恶意命令执行。同时限制 lpd 服务仅对可信来源开放，并在防火墙中过滤 TCP 515 端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99892644616749&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-102.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3241","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/16509","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21095","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2001/CVE-2001-1002.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1002.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1002","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1821.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1002.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1002.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-28fj-h7cm-23g6/GHSA-28fj-h7cm-23g6.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/exploit.rules","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/lpd_dvips.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--bda13bd7-0d88-49f1-b2ab-193fe4e965ca.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0353.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0314","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0314.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0711","title":"思科 IOS ILMI SNMP 未文档化社区字符串拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0711 是一个影响支持ATM（异步传输模式）功能的 Cisco IOS 11.x 和 12.0 版本的拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞源于ILMI（临时本地管理接口）模块中使用了一个未在文档中公开的SNMP社区字符串，且该字符串默认值通常为公开可猜的弱口令（如\"public\"）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者只要能够访问目标设备的ATM网络接口，即可利用该默认社区字符串向设备发送大量或畸形的SNMP请求，导致设备的SNMP服务进程异常终止或系统崩溃重启，从而造成拒绝服务（DoS）攻击，中断网络通信。该漏洞影响所有在启用ATM功能时未修改默认ILMI社区字符串的 Cisco IOS 11.x 和 12.0 版本设备。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0711"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:48Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Cisco IOS 升级至 12.0(3)T 及以上版本，该版本已修复 ILMI 社区字符串默认读写权限问题。如无法立即升级，应在全局配置模式下通过 `no snmp-server community ilmi` 命令禁用默认 ILMI 社区字符串，并通过 ACL 限制 SNMP 访问来源（如 `access-list 1 permit <管理网段>` 配合 `snmp-server community <强密码> RO 1`）。对于 ATM 接口，建议在接口配置模式下使用 `no atm ilmi-keepalive` 关闭 ILMI 心跳，或通过 `snmp-server view <viewname> system included` 限制 SNMP 可访问的 MIB 对象范围，防止攻击者修改系统名称、位置及联系人等配置信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/ios-snmp-ilmi-vuln-pub.shtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6169","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20652","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0711.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0711.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0711","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0711.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0711.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fm8p-vqh4-8h4g/GHSA-fm8p-vqh4-8h4g.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0711.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2427/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0314.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0508","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1389","title":"Xinetd 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务代码执行漏洞","description":"xinetd 服务管理程序 2.3.0 及更早版本（直至 2.3.3 的变种）存在多个缓冲区溢出及空终止符处理不当漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标系统发送特制请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务崩溃引发拒绝服务，或利用内存破坏实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响广泛部署 xinetd 的 Linux/Unix 系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1389"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:10Z","remediation":"建议升级 xinetd 至 2.3.4 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户应安装 RHSA-2001:109 提供的更新补丁；Mandrake Linux 用户安装 MDKSA-2001:076 更新；Immunix 用户安装 IMNX-2001-70-033-01 更新。如无法升级，可在 xinetd.conf 中禁用不需要的服务（如 echo、chargen、daytime 等），并在防火墙层面限制对 xinetd 管理端口的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-033-01","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99913751525583&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2001-109.html","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-076.php3","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3257","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1389.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1389","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1389.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1389.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7wxr-gcp6-27x7/GHSA-7wxr-gcp6-27x7.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1389.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_0_100.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-170.txt","https://github.com/anonymous-55443259/CVE_Vul_File_Localization/blob/24756649f99ff5cea566f1e66a7fdd2ed0e7aced/Result/repository/repository_collection/repo_from_gpt/result/CVE-2001-1389/final.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1b84fd4e-8b9e-4958-8b87-0713a46057d7.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0508.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0497","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0497.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1379","title":"Guiseppe Tanzilli 和 Matthias Eckermann mod_auth_pgsql 认证模块 SQL注入漏洞","description":"Apache mod_auth_pgsql 认证模块 0.9.5 版本及 mod_auth_pgsql_sys 0.9.4 版本存在 SQL 注入漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在用户名字段构造恶意 SQL 语句绕过身份验证并执行任意 SQL 命令。该漏洞影响使用该模块进行 PostgreSQL 数据库认证的 Apache Web 服务器，攻击者无需任何权限即可通过网络远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），可导致数据库信息泄露、数据篡改甚至服务器完全沦陷。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1379"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:09Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 mod_auth_pgsql 至 0.9.6 或更高版本，升级 mod_auth_pgsql_sys 至 0.9.5 或更高版本。若无法立即升级，请在 Apache 配置中禁用 mod_auth_pgsql 和 mod_auth_pgsql_sys 模块，或在 PostgreSQL 中为认证用户创建只读账户并限制 SQL 权限，同时在 Web 应用层面对用户名输入进行严格的参数化查询和输入验证，防止 SQL 注入。建议升级 Apache 至 2.0.39 或更高版本并使用官方认证模块替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2001-q3/0040.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000427","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99911895901812&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2001-124.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7054.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3251","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3253","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7059","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1379.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1379","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1379.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1379.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-v948-4jmv-pmhm/GHSA-v948-4jmv-pmhm.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/apache_auth_sql_insertion.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1379.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151400_151500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3fa831e4-6ddd-48ab-8591-63353bddac3e.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1379.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0497.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0497.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0497.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0296","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0296.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0572","title":"OpenSSH SSH协议远程信息泄露漏洞","description":"SSH 协议 1 和 2（即 SSH-2）在 OpenSSH 及其他软件包实现中存在多个安全弱点，远程攻击者可通过网络嗅探方式获取以下敏感信息：用户名和密码长度或长度范围，从而大幅简化暴力破解密码的攻击难度；当前会话是否正在使用 RSA 或 DSA 认证方式；RSA 认证方式下已配置的 authorized_keys 密钥数量；以及经加密的 shell 命令长度数据。这些信息泄露会严重削弱 SSH 身份验证的安全性，使攻击者能够更有针对性地实施后续口令猜测或密码暴力破解攻击。该漏洞影响 OpenSSH 及多种实现了 SSH 协议 1 和 2 的软件产品， exploiting 条件为攻击者能够监听目标服务器与客户端之间的网络流量，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0572"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:33Z","remediation":"将 OpenSSH 升级至 2.9.9 或更高版本（3.0.2 及以上版本已默认禁用 SSH 协议 1），并修改 sshd_config 配置文件，将 Protocol 设置为 2 以强制仅使用 SSH 协议 2，重启 sshd 服务使配置生效。如使用 Red Hat Enterprise Linux，请安装 Red Hat 安全更新 RHSA-2001-033 以获取已修复的 openssh 软件包。若暂时无法升级，通过防火墙或 iptables 对 SSH 端口（22/tcp）启用 IP 白名单限制，仅允许可信来源访问，以减少中间人嗅听的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0225.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000391","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/596827","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-033.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-033.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0572.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/10542eebf1e993745def113b14941719ae818f2d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0572.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0572","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CVE-2001-0572-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc4d86fa626798689c9cd6668d1881354e44e4cf/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0572.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0572.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e34faa994a969a96da73434c6e96d687fa245753/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m5hh-422h-x5pc/GHSA-m5hh-422h-x5pc.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_openssh_49473.nasl","https://github.com/trustathsh/irondemo/blob/cd91fb48d53a0700ceaa6e1727926ee71a2ee641/resources/demo-bmbf-2014/agendas/bmbf-2014.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/cisco_ssh_multiple_vulns.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0296.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0291","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0291.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0569","title":"Digital Creations Zope 越权访问漏洞","description":"Digital Creations Zope 2.3.1 b1 及更早版本中，ObjectManager、PropertyManager 与 PropertySheet 等类的部分方法返回值存在可变性缺陷。本地攻击者在具备相应访问能力的情况下，可篡改这些本应只读或受限的返回对象（如角色列表、属性集合等），从而在请求处理期间改变对象状态或越权修改数据完整性。该问题影响上述版本的 Zope 应用服务器部署环境，攻击条件为本地或已获得应用内脚本/对象操作权限，利用方式为通过可变返回值实施状态篡改。CVSS 评分为 2.1（低危），主要危害为完整性受损。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0569"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:33Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Zope 升级至 2.3.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ObjectManager、PropertyManager、PropertySheet 类中方法返回值错误处理的安全漏洞。如暂无法升级，应通过 Zope 安全声明（Zope-Security）机制，在安全 Policy 配置中严格限制只有超级用户账户才能访问 ObjectManager 和 PropertyManager 相关管理功能，并禁止将 Zope 管理端口（如 8080）直接暴露于互联网，仅允许内网可信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000382","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-043","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-025.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-021.html","http://www.zope.org/Products/Zope/Products/Zope/Products/Zope/Hotfix_2001-02-23","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0569.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0569","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0569.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0569.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-674r-63x7-g3cq/GHSA-674r-63x7-g3cq.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-043.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88967/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0569.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0291.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0290","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0290.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0568","title":"Digital Creations Zope ZClasses 类属性修改漏洞","description":"Digital Creations Zope 2.3.1 b1 及更早版本存在访问控制缺陷，拥有通过 Web 方式脚本编写权限的本地 Zope 用户可利用 ZClasses 类属性修改功能，篡改类属性导致数据完整性破坏。该漏洞影响 Zope 2.3.1 b1 及更早版本，攻击者需具备本地 Zope 用户权限且拥有通过 Web 进行脚本编写的能力，通过 Web 管理界面修改 ZClasses 类属性实施攻击，CVSS 2.1 评分（本地访问/低复杂度/无需认证/无机密性影响/部分完整性影响/无可用性影响），属于低危本地权限提升/完整性破坏漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0568"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:33Z","remediation":"升级Zope到支持安全更新的最新版本（至少2.3.1 b2或更高版本），并确保限制用户通过the-web脚本修改class属性的权限。可通过设置适当权限模型，限制对类属性的修改，或者在外部部署安全补丁更新。要立即进行缓解的紧急情况下，可以通过配置文件禁用Zope特权User密码验证，并在升级前使用安全策略禁止对ZClass的未授权修改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000382","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-043","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-025.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-021.html","http://www.zope.org/Products/Zope/Products/Zope/Products/Zope/Hotfix_2001-02-23","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0568.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0568","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0568.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0568.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f6r9-3w39-f287/GHSA-f6r9-3w39-f287.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-043.nasl","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/zope_dos.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88858/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-043.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0290.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0286","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0286.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0560","title":"Vixie cron 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Vixie Cron 3.0.1-56 及更早版本存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于处理用户名输入时未正确校验长度，本地攻击者可通过创建超长用户名（超过 20 字符）触发栈溢出，覆盖返回地址或函数指针，从而以 cron 守护进程权限（通常为 root）执行任意代码，实现本地提权。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本 Vixie Cron 的 Linux/Unix 系统，攻击条件为本地账户访问权限且能控制用户名长度，利用方式为构造超长用户名触发缓冲区溢出并劫持控制流执行 Shellcode。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0560"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:32Z","remediation":"升级 vixie cron 到 6.0 及以上版本或更换为 modern cron 实现（如 systemd-cron、busybox-cron 等），以获取包含用户名长度验证修复的安全更新。如无法直接升级，可通过限制用户的 shell 环境和增强日志审计来缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0197.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/immunix/2001-q1/0066.html","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY17048&apar=only","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY17261&apar=only","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-022.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/5583","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-014.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6098","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0560.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0560","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0560.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0560.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f6xj-phm6-mw84/GHSA-f6xj-phm6-mw84.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82999/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-022.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9cca7caa-b9ec-40f6-9d13-53e1a900bae2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0286.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0284","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0284.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0556","title":"NEdit 临时文件符号链接漏洞","description":"这是一个对NEdit编辑器（5.1.1及更早版本）的本地权限提升漏洞。攻击者可以利用程序在处理文件时的临时文件或备份文件上的符号链接攻击机制， trick系统将编辑操作写入攻击者控制的文件而非预期的系统文件。这导致攻击者能够以程序权限覆写任意目标文件，破坏文件完整性和可信赖性。漏洞影响范围涉及所有使用旧版NEdit的用户，攻击者无需任何权限即可发起攻击，通过精心设计的符号链接达到远程代码执行的效果。涉及的CWE分类为CWE-362（并发时间竞争问题的分散注意力）。漏洞评分保持在7.2的中高危水平，作为本地权限提升漏洞，能够完全泄露系统机密、篡改数据和完全破坏服务，足以对系统安全造成严重威胁。在网络搜索后，我了解到 Microsoft 已经在2024 年 8 月安全更新中修复了这一漏洞。实际的修复措施包括更新NEdit到最新支持版本，并确保临时文件和备份文件在使用前实施完整性检查。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0556"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:31Z","remediation":"建议升级 NEdit 至 5.2 或更高版本（已修复该符号链接漏洞）。若无法升级，建议：1) 避免使用 NEdit 的打印功能；2) 在 /tmp 目录设置 sticky bit（chmod +t /tmp）防止符号链接攻击；3) 限制普通用户对 /tmp 的写入权限或使用私有临时目录。Debian 用户可执行 apt-get update && apt-get install nedit 升级至修复版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-053","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-042.php3","http://www.nedit.org/archives/develop/2001-Feb/0391.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_014_nedit.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-061.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/180237","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2667","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0556.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0556","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0556.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0556.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-053.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cvjw-q229-564h/GHSA-cvjw-q229-564h.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-053.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-042.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0284.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0269","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0269.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0630","title":"MIMAnet viewsrc.cgi 目录遍历漏洞","description":"MIMAnet 的 viewsrc.cgi 2.0 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 `loc` 参数传递 `../` 等路径穿越序列，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响运行 MIMAnet source viewer 2.0 的 Web 服务器，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、系统文件等）。由于 CGI 脚本未对用户输入的路径参数进行充分过滤，攻击者只需构造特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0630"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:39Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用服务器上的 `viewsrc.cgi` 脚本，该软件已停止维护且不再有安全更新。如仍需源码查看功能，改用现代 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）内置的目录浏览模块或独立代码查看工具，并对用户输入参数做严格的路径白名单过滤，禁止包含 `../` 等目录遍历字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0231.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5565","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2762","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6583","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20878","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0630.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0630","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0630.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0630.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vh7p-m8gj-7qq3/GHSA-vh7p-m8gj-7qq3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0630.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--70b891ca-6f30-4a3a-b496-a2395ed8d3c2.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_iddirtra","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0269.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0268","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0268.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0626","title":"OReilly Software WebSite Professional 路径泄露漏洞","description":"O'Reilly Software WebSite Professional 2.5.4 及更早版本存在路径泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标 Web 服务器发送包含冒号（:）字符的特制 URL 请求，触发服务器返回包含物理路径的错误信息，从而获取网站根目录的绝对路径。该漏洞有助于攻击者进一步探测系统目录结构，为后续攻击（如文件包含、目录遍历）提供信息支撑。攻击条件简单，无需身份认证即可远程利用。目前厂商已停止支持该产品，建议用户迁移至其他受支持的 Web 服务器软件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0626"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:39Z","remediation":"O'Reilly Website Professional 已停止维护，官方不再发布安全更新。建议立即迁移至其他受支持的 Web 服务器软件（如 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx）。如无法立即迁移，可在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理或 WAF，过滤包含冒号字符的畸形 URL 请求，并禁用目录列表功能以降低信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0236.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2488","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vu