任意系统命令。攻击条件简单，仅需目标系统运行受影响版本的 Carello 软件且可被网络访问，危害等级高，可能导致服务器完全被控、数据泄露或进一步横向移动。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0614"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:38Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 Pacific Software Carello E-Commerce 1.2.1 及更早版本，该产品已停止维护，无官方补丁。建议立即从 Web 服务器中删除或禁用 `/scripts/Carello/Carello.dll` 脚本，或通过 IIS 应用程序映射移除 .dll 的脚本映射。如业务必须保留，应在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则，拦截包含 `CARELLOCODE=` 及 `VBEXE=` 参数的 URL 请求，并限制 `cmd.exe` 等系统命令的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98991352402073&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6532","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20850","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0614.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0614","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0614.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0614.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v26x-mmmw-vpcf/GHSA-v26x-mmmw-vpcf.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/carello.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0614.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88780/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/